Homepage: https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-local-generator
Description: Z-Image-Turbo model weights for tt-local-generator
 Downloads Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo from HuggingFace. Required for the
 Z-Image-Turbo image generation mode (P150X4 hardware). Status: functional
 in tt-inference-server v0.17.0.
 .
 The model is publicly available; a HuggingFace account is not required,
 though providing a token avoids API rate limits.
